(s)","ja":"状況","kana":"","img":""},{"en":"wage(s)","ja":"賃金、給料","kana":"","img":""},{"en":"working","ja":"［名詞の前に用いて］働く","kana":"","img":""},{"en":"fair","ja":"博覧会、フェア","kana":"","img":""},{"en":"prohibit","ja":"（法律・規則などが）…を禁止する","kana":"","img":""},{"en":"labor","ja":"労働","kana":"","img":""},{"en":"responsible","ja":"（人が）（物事に対して）責任がある","kana":"","img":""}]}